1/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]meet_continuation_goes_last.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/meet_continuation_goes_last.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-fx[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-fx/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob capture x places the MEET continuation last[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]capture[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture: move the close-created MEET continuation below the last open [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Pomodoro in bob-cli's ledger close, update the shared close vector, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs, and tests, and (per the decision) report it in JSON, human output,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the Bob Mac Capture close card.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Obsidian Ctrl+Enter completion mirrors the placement[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cycler[dim] · [dim][/dim]after capture[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cycler: port the same placement to the Task Status Cycler's Pomodoro [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion plan and cursor, re-copy the shared close vectors, update the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin and bob-cli docs, then build, test, and sync the plugins.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-fx","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-fx.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-65248b6a73b40817daa81698e94dc81a","started_at":"2026-11-02T15:08:46.611522+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[